{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpeNpJJ7R4wnmbeE4KUs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision\n\nI'll work through this decision step by step.\n\n## The Request\n- **ID**: DR-9001\n- **Customer**: Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048) / Acme Mfg. Holdings (ERP C-1001) — same customer, different systems\n- **Product**: NS-500 Industrial Controller (SKU)\n- **Requested discount**: 15%\n- **Request date**: 2026-09-23\n- **Requestor**: Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example)\n- **Basis**: \"Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement\" — relies on a customer contract term\n\n## Commercial Eligibility\n\n**Active contract on request date?** Yes. ACME-MFG-2025 (effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31) is active on 2026-09-23 and covers NS-500.\n\n**Pricing exception?** Yes. The contract references Schedule B, which is registered as **EXC-ACME-NS500-15**.\n- Effective: 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31 (active on 2026-09-23)\n- Product: NS-500 only\n- Maximum discount: **15% of list price**\n- Superseded the earlier EXC-ACME-NS500-10 (which expired 2025-03-31)\n\nThe requested discount of 15% is **within** the maximum permitted by the exception. **Status: eligible.**\n\n## Approval Authority\n\n**Policy in effect on 2026-09-23:** PRICING-POLICY-2026 (2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31). This supersedes the 2025 policy.\n\n**Requestor's authority:** Sarah Chen is an Enterprise Account Executive.\n- Under PRICING-POLICY-2026, Enterprise Account Executives may approve discounts up to and including **10%**.\n- The request is for **15%**, which exceeds her authority.\n\n**Required approver:** The policy states discounts greater than 10% and up to and including 20% require **VP Sales** approval. The Approval Authority Matrix confirms this.\n- VP Sales is **Michael Torres** (michael.torres@northstar.example).\n\n## Decision\n\nSarah Chen cannot approve this herself, but the customer is commercially eligible. Michael Torres (VP Sales) must review and authorize.\n\nPrinciples applied:\n- \"Contractual eligibility does not change employee authority\" — the fact that the contract permits 15% does not authorize Sarah Chen to approve it; employee authority is determined by the pricing policy.\n- \"A request must not be approved solely because a customer contract permits the requested discount\" — this is a textbook case of that rule.\n- All special terms (contract and exception) are established and active on the request date.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9001\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048) / Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"eligible\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"basis\": \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 pricing exception (Schedule B to ACME-MFG-2025 contract)\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"PRICING-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"10%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"ACME-MFG-2025 Master Supply Agreement (active 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31, covers NS-500)\",\n    \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 pricing exception (active 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31, maximum 15% on NS-500)\",\n    \"PRICING-POLICY-2026 (effective 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31, EAE authority ≤10%)\",\n    \"Approval Authority Matrix 2026 (VP Sales authority >10% and ≤20%)\",\n    \"Employee record: Sarah Chen, Enterprise Account Executive\",\n    \"Employee record: Michael Torres, VP Sales\",\n    \"CRM account CRM-2048, ERP customer C-1001, DUNS 04-812-7730 (same customer)\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5925,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5925},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6a3c6034-c64b-4019-9156-6c9cb8774da8","uuid":"71925919-2d6b-4d1e-85ce-42219c9cb685","timestamp":"2026-10-08T10:54:20.537Z","request_id":"req_011CfpeNp6PztAxzmsiXz82M"}
